WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:03.870
Good morning Hank, it's Friday. I have a 101.2°
fever; we'll see if that affects my video

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.870
making.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:08.260
So Nerdfighteria, I was so impressed with
